{"ref":"BDB, צַפַּ֫חַת","hw":"צַפַּ֫חַת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צַפַּ֫חַת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. jar, jug</strong>, of flat or broad shape;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַפּ֑חַתּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.12\">1 K 17:12</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַפַּחַת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.11\">1 S 26:11</a> +;—<em>jar</em> or <em>jug</em> for water <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.11\">1 S 26:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.6\">1 K 19:6</a>; for oil <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.12\">1 K 17:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:14\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.16\">16</a> (on masc. verb <span dir=\"rtl\">חָסֵר</span> v. Ew<sup>§ 317 c</sup>, but prob. read <span dir=\"rtl\">חָסֵ֑רָה</span> SS Albr<sup>ZAW xvi (1896), 89</sup>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:14\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.14\">14</a>).","next":"BDB, צַפִּיחִת","prev":"BDB, צפח"}